Ours.  Declarations gcc 14 needs, for each function called with no declaration,
taken from the definition the call links with (the K&R definitions take no narrow
parameters and return an implicit int), or from the system header that declares it:
  programs/xeyes/transform.h: TFillPolygon, TDrawArc, TFillArc (with <X11/Xlib.h>);
    SetTransform
  programs/xeyes/Eyes.c: eyeLiner, eyeBall
  programs/xeyes/transform.c: <stdlib.h> (malloc, free)
  programs/xedit/xedit.h: <stdlib.h> (exit)

